count":7,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"7處獨立位置，7個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete-ws1999801"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_reading_cases":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:source_review35-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"dlu_ho5_zsx","source_quote":"初，偽太后馮氏兄昌黎王馮莎二女，大馮美而有疾，為尼，小馮為宏皇后，生偽太子詢。後大馮疾差，宏納為昭儀。宏初徙都，詢意不樂，思歸桑乾。宏制衣冠與之，詢竊毀裂，解髮為編服左衽。大馮有寵，日夜讒詢。宏出鄴城馬射，詢因是欲叛北歸，密選宮中御馬三千疋置河陰渚。皇后聞之，召執詢，馳使告宏，宏徙詢無鼻城，在河橋北二里，尋殺之，以庶人禮葬。立大馮為皇后，便立偽太子恪，是歲，偽太和二十年也。","reading":"大馮、小馮與太子詢成一宮廷附敘。《魏書》另以林氏為恂生母，馮氏兩后職位與年月分讀。","note":"大馮、小馮與太子詢成一宮廷附敘。《魏書》另以林氏為恂生母，馮氏兩后職位與年月分讀。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p035","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":188,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete-ws1999801"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:variant_review35-26","kind":"variant_review","person_id":"dlu_ho5_zsx","source_quote":"小馮為宏皇后，生偽太子詢","reading":"魏書后妃、孝文五王均以貞后林氏生恂；保留齊書小馮說作異文，另列母系所據。","note":"魏書后妃、孝文五王均以貞后林氏生恂；保留齊書小馮說作異文，另列母系所據。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p035","start_codepoint":26,"end_codepoint":38,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete-ws1999801"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:variant_review35-163","kind":"variant_review","person_id":"dlu_ho5_zsx","source_quote":"立大馮為皇后","reading":"魏書紀昭儀馮氏立后另有年月，勿以元恂被廢、卒、元恪立數事同日。","note":"魏